    81	// cacheRootMembers counts the cache root by class: the live entries, what was
    82	// moved aside rather than deleted, and any private staging left behind.
    83	//
    84	// Every compensation in this package is a rename, so quarantined only ever
    85	// grows — that is how a case proves no byte of a displaced entry was destroyed
    86	// on the way back — while staged must always return to zero, because a
    87	// publication that failed has no business leaving a half-built entry in a
    88	// shared root.
    89	func cacheRootMembers(t *testing.T, store *Store, key buildmeta.CacheKey) (live, quarantined, staged int) {
