   535	// TestAPublicationThatCannotRestoreReportsAChangedCache covers the one case the
   536	// compensation cannot fix: a fault inside the compensation itself.
   537	//
   538	// Silence here would be the worst outcome of all, because the caller would read
   539	// an ordinary failure and go on telling the operator the live build cache is
   540	// unchanged. Each case asserts the error says otherwise, and asserts exactly
   541	// which entry is live — a usable one in every case, never an empty slot a live
   542	// launcher would resolve to nothing.
   543	func TestAPublicationThatCannotRestoreReportsAChangedCache(t *testing.T) {
